WEBVTT

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.720
I haven't woken up yet.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.350
Hmm...

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.540
It's already 7 o'clock!

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:29.360
I have to wake up!

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:37.300
7.30? Did you just say 7.30?

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:07.690
Wait a minute, I'll put it back before I wake up.

00:01:30.028 --> 00:01:30.528
SISTAR!

00:02:49.612 --> 00:02:50.112
What?

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:02.840
What's so funny?

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.400
I won't get angry.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.390
You're so scary.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:08.670
I'm not scared.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:09.880
Yes.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:19.830
I'll leave it to you.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:24.320
I don't care.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.400
Let's go to school ASAP!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:05.560
Um, I set my alarm and went to bed, but for some reason it didn't work...

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:06.980
You don't need to make excuses!

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.520
As a punishment for being late, I'll give you a Grand Jushu!

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.420
What!? Jushu!?

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.060
Ah...

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:20.330
Kuryo...

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.630
Rime...

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:37.830
Is that why you're late?

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:47.420
Saki, I'm so hungry that I need to calm down and eat a little more

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:56.710
Ah, I was surprised

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.730
I was surprised here

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.480
I wish I could have eaten a little more calmly.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.300
Because I couldn't eat breakfast properly,

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:09.180
and I had to rush to school and take a 10-week class on top of that!

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.100
I'm so flabby!

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.420
Are you really flabby?

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:19.070
You might have stopped yourself like this before you realized it, right?

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:20.240
Oh, no!

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.700
I can't say that.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:24.680
Yes.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:29.830
I was so distracted that I couldn't say anything.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.480
I wonder if I did something bad to Flappy without even asking him.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:36.450
I think you were shocked because you were suspected earlier, Choppy.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:39.290
Flappy, I'm sorry.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.030
Poh!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.730
You look like you're in a bad mood.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.640
I wonder how I can make you feel better.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:48.520
Choppy!

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.560
Let's go to the beach together for tomorrow's vacation!

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.620
I'm sure I'll do it, too!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.150
I'm going to burn you to death!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.070
You're going to burn me to death!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.690
Yahoo, sir!

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:11.090
Salute!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.190
Chachacha!

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:15.810
Do you really understand what's going on right now?

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.190
What's going on?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:18.540
What's going on, sir?

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.850
You haven't been able to retrieve the Izumi of the tree

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.270
and you haven't been able to find the Izumi of the sun,

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:28.550
which makes you very angry.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:34.720
Of course I know, senyor! That's why I'm dancing like this, senyor!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:39.290
You know it, so you're dancing. What does that mean?

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:45.780
What it means and what it means, you'll know when you see this embarrassing dance, senyor!

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.400
I don't know! I don't know at all!

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:52.970
Finally, I've become serious, too.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.470
No, I really don't know what it means.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:57.090
No!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.290
You're a weirdo.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:16.500
I worked hard last week, and you must be hungry too, Flappy.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.270
Flappy, are you still angry?

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.010
Are you sure you're not feeling well?

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:40.980
When did you become like this?

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:42.090
Ah...

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:46.660
I'm sorry, Captain.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:53.060
Flappy, I'm sorry for not listening to you at all.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.040
What should I do?

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:56.880
Well...

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:07.150
Niki Niki Niki Niki

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.350
Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu Kyu

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:10.020
Yaaaaa

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:15.300
Frappi, you've become suspicious and in a bad mood.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:16.850
It's been a long day.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:27.370
Let's go home.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.540
Um...

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.760
I came to the village and there was a lot of things.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.240
That's right.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:05.330
Life in such a small world is pretty hard, Flappy.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:10.400
Flappy, I'm talking about when I just entered elementary school.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:18.490
Everything is a new world and there are so many people I don't know.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:23.620
I suddenly became anxious and cried a lot.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:28.020
I couldn't stop crying until my father and mother came to pick me up.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:34.700
Then, my mother gave me a towel with an app so that I can always be smiling.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:41.690
Isn't it strange for me to cry so much?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.670
Good night.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.800
I hope you get better soon.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:30.360
Pee?

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:46.160
Isn't it good?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:55.550
Isn't it better to do it like this?

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.760
The Chinese are the best!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.430
I won't bother you anymore, Korone!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:09.860
But you're so energetic.

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:11.550
You're so strong.

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.640
Do you want anything else?

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.460
Anything you want to drink?

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:20.140
Why are you so kind, Lapi?

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:23.380
You just recovered from your illness, didn't you?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.080
It's only natural to be kind to people who are weak.

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.640
Thank you, Lapi.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:31.670
Did you say something?

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:46.860
Did you get tired because of a bad life?

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.140
You look like that, so you're surprisingly delicate.

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:52.720
Don't flap!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:29.290
I'm sorry, but I'm not a person.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.460
This is a living creature.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:31.520
Is this alive?

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:33.690
Yes, it's alive.

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:41.930
I'm going to catch a cold again, so let's play over there.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.680
What does our world look like to you?

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:53.300
What?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.790
What are the opportunities?

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:59.800
By being with us, we can do something happy and enjoyable.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.060
I thought it would be great if you could find a lot of fun things.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.230
Senorita, I'm so happy to see you!

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:39.060
Hahaha, you're so energetic, Senorita!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.070
But you won't reply to me?

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:48.100
Well, today I'm going to teach you what it's like to live in the sun, Senorita.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:55.230
I just want to know what it's like to live in the sun, Senorita.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.970
If you tell me, I promise you a peaceful life.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:14.040
If you're not going to tell me, why don't you go swimming in the ocean?

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.920
The ocean in spring is so cold, Crawl.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.510
If I do that, Flappy will catch a cold again.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:26.940
You're really stubborn.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.420
Cool your head and think again.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.920
GIVE IT TO ME!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:31.380
WAIT!

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.830
First of all, you guys!

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:35.820
What?

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:59.460
What? What are you talking about?

00:15:05.916 --> 00:15:07.916
You

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:03.800
No one will get in my way.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:10.200
I'll give all of Izumi to Lord Akudai Kaan.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:10.920
I won't give it to you!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:11.600
What?!

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:16.030
You're so stubborn, senorita!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:21.660
This time...

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:26.720
What?!

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:32.780
I will not let you go!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:37.500
I will not let you go!

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:38.220
I will not let you go!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.450
It's still a long way to go, senorita.

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:16.280
I'm embarrassed.

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.670
I ate and drank medicine.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.010
Now I just need to sleep.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.890
Call me if you need anything.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.500
Good night.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:51.880
Therapy?

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.960
You don't have to worry about anything.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:58.540
Just sleep for one night and you'll be fine.

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:00.650
I'll see you next time.

00:21:00.988 --> 00:21:01.488
Oh!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:40.250
I'm sorry, Flappy.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:42.170
You should understand, Flappy.

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:42.920
Saki?

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:43.760
Are you done?

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:47.130
What do you think?

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:51.880
I'm done, Flappy.

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:56.200
I don't remember.

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:58.240
I've used up all my energy.

00:21:58.240 --> 00:21:58.520
I don't remember.

00:22:00.572 --> 00:22:01.892
Don't take it back!

00:22:02.236 --> 00:22:02.976
Alright!

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:01.570
Brick Blast Star!

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:03.900
Is it a bit homesick?

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:04.990
With the power of honest,

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:05.310
frank,

00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:06.190
and exciting power,

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:06.650
it's perfect!
